df['Price Difference'] = df.iloc[:, 2] - df.iloc[:, 1] 

# Sort by Price Difference in descending order
df_sorted = df.sort_values(by='Price Difference', ascending=False)

print(df_sorted[['Dish', 'Price Difference']])
```

